“Only 1 room left at this price!” flashes beside a hotel offer: {{1}}
At the top of the shop’s website, a clock counts down – “Deal ends in 09:58”: {{2}}
At the final checkout step, a “service fee” and delivery are suddenly added to the price: {{3}}
The free trial month automatically becomes a paid subscription – and the cancel button is buried deep in the menu: {{4}}
In the order form, “Yes, send me offers by email” is already ticked: {{5}}
The button for declining says “No thanks, I’d rather miss out on the benefits”: {{6}}
You buy a box in a game for CHF 4.90 – chance decides what is inside: {{7}}
In the middle of a game, a message appears: “Get 500 crystals for CHF 9.90”: {{8}}
“Your workshop will be ready in 7 hours – or instantly for 60 rubies”: {{9}}
“Your streak: 41 days! Play today or lose it”: {{10}}
